# Yoimiya Furina Yelan Citlali. ~22s Rot. VapeMelt Yoimiya. 2E Yelan, Yelan ensures that she catches her own particles. Freeze immunity is -3K DPS. Fav on 1 of Furina, Yelan, or Escoffier results in similar DPS.

